    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nestled discreetly just off the Stillorgan Road in the heart of Donnybrook, No. 4A Belville Mews is a highly distinctive two bedroom detached residence, offering a superb blend of privacy, character and modern city living. This unique home stands apart from the ordinary, culminating in a stunning, large private roof garden an exceptional feature in such a prime Dublin 4 location.\r\n\r\nExtending to 78sqm, the accommodation has been thoughtfully designed to maximise light and space throughout. The property offers two bedrooms (master en suite), a family bathroom, a bright and spacious living area and a well appointed kitchen, all presented in excellent condition. The property also benefits from a secure car port for one car.\r\n\r\nA standout feature of this property is its remarkable outdoor space. The expansive roof garden provides a private oasis, ideal for relaxing, or simply enjoying elevated views in complete seclusion, an outstanding luxury in this sought after setting.\r\n\r\nImportantly, No. 4A also offers significant further development potential. The property has previously benefited from full planning permission to transform the property into an impressive 3 storey home (final image amongst photography), presenting an exciting opportunity for a purchaser to enhance and expand the existing accommodation to suit their needs (subject to planning permission). This adds a compelling layer of long term value and flexibility in a prime Dublin 4 location.\r\n\r\nThe location is second to none. Donnybrook is one of Dublin’s most desirable addresses, offering an unrivalled selection of amenities right on your doorstep. Residents will enjoy easy access to an array of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and shops, along with excellent transport links providing swift access to the city centre and beyond. Herbert Park, UCD and Ballsbridge are all within easy reach, making this an ideal choice for , downsizers, or investors alike.\r\n\r\nNo. 4A Belville Mews represents an outstanding opportunity to acquire a truly special home with future potential in one of Dublin’s most prestigious and convenient locations. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tExceptional two bedroom detached mews residence.\r\n•\tHighly unique property with strong architectural character.\r\n•\tLarge private roof garden.\r\n•\tSignificant development potential with previous full planning permission granted.\r\n•\tSecure off street parking.\r\n•\tExcellent transport links and proximity to the city centre\r\n•\tClose to Herbert Park, UCD, Ballsbridge, and a host of local amenities."
      },
